From 72b44781cea70588c6b70ec93974d9b4bcb20277 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Taimoor Ul Islam <tislam@iastate.edu>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 11:33:36 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 04/54] kaiair: add pktr_link_state, per-link EWMA interference
 statistics (UL)

Header-only per-link store for the receiver-side interference+noise NI = RSRP - SINR,
derived from per-packet UL measurements. Maintains an EWMA mean (PktR's I_R) and variance
(the interference part of the Cantelli sigma term), with configurable filter memory c
(default 15/16, per PRKS/PktR). Channel-side stats and the SINR beta-quantile come later.

Standalone + unit-tested (7/7): NI derivation, exact mean on constant streams, step-change
convergence, variance behavior, filter agility vs memory, reset. Not yet wired into the
scheduler (next step). First Phase-1 code.
